  "system": {
    "slug": "commander-bailey",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 7
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Commander Armando-Owen Bailey is the gruff, pragmatic head of C-Sec on the Citadel's wards. He keeps the peace with a combination of street-level authority and a willingness to bend rules when the situation demands it. He is not hostile to outside operators — he will deal straight and expects the same in return. When he is forced to fight, he fights dirty and efficiently.</p><p><strong>C-Sec Authority:</strong> In areas under Citadel jurisdiction, Bailey has a +4 circumstance bonus to Intimidation checks and may attempt to Demoralize as a free action once per round.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
        "title": "Mass Effect Compendium",
